        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an unforgettable journey through the most picturesque corners of the USA! If you love hidden object adventures, this game will be your perfect companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of magnificent locations await you—from majestic canyons and national parks to bustling metropolises and cozy coastal towns. Each scene is filled with atmosphere and details you’ll want to take in. This isn’t just a search for objects—it’s a true virtual journey where every turn reveals a new attraction.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609910/extras/d318a412f62f509a3e0c7b16b2ca34bd.poster.avif?t=1776254116\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609910/extras/d318a412f62f509a3e0c7b16b2ca34bd.webm?t=1776254116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609910/extras/d318a412f62f509a3e0c7b16b2ca34bd.mp4?t=1776254116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world at your own pace: no rush, just pure enjoyment. Alternate between finding hidden objects and solving a variety of puzzles and mini-games—from classic jigsaws to logic challenges. Plus, collect unique souvenirs from every corner of America to preserve your adventure memories:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 colorful and detailed locations inspired by real places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging mini-games and puzzles that diversify the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing atmosphere: beautiful music, a leisurely pace, and the chance to fully immerse yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectible elements—find souvenirs and fill your travel album.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609910/extras/822215b60acffcd45f20ecd49ac92f87.poster.avif?t=1776254116\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609910/extras/822215b60acffcd45f20ecd49ac92f87.webm?t=1776254116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609910/extras/822215b60acffcd45f20ecd49ac92f87.mp4?t=1776254116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br>The Collector’s Edition enhances your journey:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique bonus locations and additional quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive puzzles and mini-games for true connoisseurs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to save your favorite landscapes as wallpapers and create your own gallery of memories.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for those who want to unwind, sharpen their attention, and enjoy a virtual stroll through America—free from rush and restrictions.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an unforgettable journey through the most picturesque corners of the USA! If you love hidden object adventures, this game will be your perfect companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of magnificent locations await you—from majestic canyons and national parks to bustling metropolises and cozy coastal towns. Each scene is filled with atmosphere and details you’ll want to take in. This isn’t just a search for objects—it’s a true virtual journey where every turn reveals a new attraction.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609910/extras/d318a412f62f509a3e0c7b16b2ca34bd.poster.avif?t=1776254116\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609910/extras/d318a412f62f509a3e0c7b16b2ca34bd.webm?t=1776254116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609910/extras/d318a412f62f509a3e0c7b16b2ca34bd.mp4?t=1776254116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world at your own pace: no rush, just pure enjoyment. Alternate between finding hidden objects and solving a variety of puzzles and mini-games—from classic jigsaws to logic challenges. Plus, collect unique souvenirs from every corner of America to preserve your adventure memories:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 colorful and detailed locations inspired by real places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging mini-games and puzzles that diversify the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing atmosphere: beautiful music, a leisurely pace, and the chance to fully immerse yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectible elements—find souvenirs and fill your travel album.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609910/extras/822215b60acffcd45f20ecd49ac92f87.poster.avif?t=1776254116\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609910/extras/822215b60acffcd45f20ecd49ac92f87.webm?t=1776254116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609910/extras/822215b60acffcd45f20ecd49ac92f87.mp4?t=1776254116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br>The Collector’s Edition enhances your journey:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique bonus locations and additional quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive puzzles and mini-games for true connoisseurs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to save your favorite landscapes as wallpapers and create your own gallery of memories.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for those who want to unwind, sharpen their attention, and enjoy a virtual stroll through America—free from rush and restrictions.</p>",
